  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"qC5Iy\" id=\"qC5Iy\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dfffda1\" id=\"u7dfffda1\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">小乌龟节点启动</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"FaraD\" id=\"FaraD\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud6c34135\" id=\"ud6c34135\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">1. 启动小乌龟模拟器节点</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20run%20turtlesim%20turtlesim_node%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aBPyK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"vyA2N\" id=\"vyA2N\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud460cd07\" id=\"ud460cd07\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2. 启动小乌龟键盘输入节点</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20run%20turtlesim%20turtle_teleop_key%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oOG12%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"Opw8Y\" id=\"Opw8Y\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8705006\" id=\"uf8705006\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">小乌龟操作原理</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"nd4bP\" id=\"nd4bP\"><span data-lake-id=\"u65664b3b\" id=\"u65664b3b\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">1. 节点信息查看</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uba46adc7\" id=\"uba46adc7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6242cd89\" id=\"u6242cd89\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">小乌龟启动过程中，我们启动了两个可执行的程序：</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua97afc1d\" id=\"ua97afc1d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">turtlesim_node</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5a0412a6\" id=\"u5a0412a6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">和</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud6cecf8c\" id=\"ud6cecf8c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">turtle_teleop_key</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud9645b4d\" id=\"ud9645b4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 。可以通过命令查看当前的启动的节点：</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"fBh49\" id=\"fBh49\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf0e3c64\" id=\"udf0e3c64\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">查看小乌龟节点</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u00d194d5\" id=\"u00d194d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa1290e4\" id=\"uaa1290e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通过命令可以查看</span><span data-lake-id=\"u83612d41\" id=\"u83612d41\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">/turtlesim</span><span data-lake-id=\"u181f6147\" id=\"u181f6147\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">节点的详情</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20node%20info%20%2Fturtlesim%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zkPBM%22%2C%22margin%