sim%2Faction%2FRotateAbsolute%5Cn%20%20Action%20Clients%3A%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LorW8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u708660e4\" id=\"u708660e4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua025bcab\" id=\"ua025bcab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">rosnode info命令可以查看当前节点的一些信息：</span></p><ul list=\"u3a526c04\"><li fid=\"u0a1137ec\" data-lake-id=\"u75821762\" id=\"u75821762\" data-lake-index-type=\"true\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72746e64\" id=\"u72746e64\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Publications：此节点上定义的发布者</span></li><li fid=\"u0a1137ec\" data-lake-id=\"ub340310f\" id=\"ub340310f\" data-lake-index-type=\"true\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c857226\" id=\"u8c857226\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Subscriptions：此节点上定义的订阅者</span></li><li fid=\"u0a1137ec\" data-lake-id=\"u31559242\" id=\"u31559242\" data-lake-index-type=\"true\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0016abd6\" id=\"u0016abd6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Services：此节点上定义的服务</span></li><li fid=\"u0a1137ec\" data-lake-id=\"u9d2963c1\" id=\"u9d2963c1\" data-lake-index-type=\"true\"><span data-lake-id=\"u889964a5\" id=\"u889964a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">进程id，占用的网络端口</span></li><li fid=\"u0a1137ec\" data-lake-id=\"u77a0eedb\" id=\"u77a0eedb\" data-lake-index-type=\"true\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f3f291e\" id=\"u4f3f291e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Connections： 此节点和其他节点间的连接信息</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"dM2OZ\" id=\"dM2OZ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ea6d295\" id=\"u9ea6d295\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">查看控制节点</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc3388dbe\" id=\"uc3388dbe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u280af5ca\" id=\"u280af5ca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">同理，我们也可以通过</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9212dc9f\" id=\"u9212dc9f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">ros2 node info</span><span data-lake-id=\"u143d6835\" id=\"u143d6835\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">查询</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub21312f4\" id=\"ub21312f4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">/teleop_turtle</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub6ddb1d7\" id=\"ub6ddb1d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">节点的信息</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20node%20info%20%2Fteleop_turtle%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Hntqo%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub382ffaf\" id=\"ub382ffaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud97002f2\" id=\"ud97002f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">结果如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2Fteleop_turtle%5Cn%20%20Subscribers%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2Fparameter_events%3A%20rcl_interfaces%2Fmsg%2FParameterEvent%5Cn%20%20Publishers%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2Fparameter_events%3A%20rcl_interfaces%2Fmsg%2FParameterEvent%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2Frosout%3A%20rcl_interfaces%2Fmsg%2FLog%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2Fturtle1%2Fcmd_vel%3A%20geometry_msgs%2Fmsg%2FTwist%5Cn%20%20Service%20Servers%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2Fteleop_turtle%2Fdescribe_parameters%3A%20rcl_interfaces%2Fsrv%2FDescribeParameters%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2Fteleo